COMMENT ON COLUMN person.person_organization_membership.person_identifier IS 'Identifier of the person participating in or belonging to the organization.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN person.person_organization_membership.membership_organization_identifier IS 'Identifier of the organization in which the person participates or holds membership.';
